<title>USA: Times Mirror Jan advertising revs rise.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror Jan advertising revs rise.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co Thursday said advertising revenues for Times Mirror's Newspaper Publishing Group for the five weeks ended February 2, 1997, increased 5.9 percent to $142,060,000 from $134,173,000 in the prior year.</p>
<p>The results for 1997 contained two fewer days than the 1996 results.</p>
